THIRD-PARTY DATA

This repository contains no dataset. It reads two public research datasets that
carry their own terms, and those terms govern the data, not this licence:

  WESAD (Wearable Stress and Affect Detection), Schmidt et al., 2018.
  Obtained from its authors under their stated conditions, which include
  non-commercial research use and citation.

